  "historyNote": "#4192, eff 12-23-86; ss by #5490, eff 10-19-92; amd by #5910, eff 10-14-94; amd by #6179, eff 1-30-96; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #12186, eff 5-25-17; ss by #12361, eff 8-9-17; amd by #12494, eff 3-21-18; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
